        <h2 style="color: #132441; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 24px 0;">Some events were not delivered</h2>

        <p style="margin: 0 0 20px 0; color: #4a4a4a; font-size: 15px;">Hello,</p>

        <p style="margin: 0 0 20px 0; color: #4a4a4a; font-size: 15px;">
          The destination <strong style="color: #132441;"><%= @destination.name %></strong>
          for project <strong style="color: #132441;"><%= @destination.project.name %></strong>
          fell further behind than the 7-day retention window, so the stream skipped ahead.
        </p>

        <div style="background-color: #fff5e5; border-radius: 6px; padding: 20px; margin: 30px 0; border: 1px solid #ffd699;">
          <h4 style="margin: 0; color: #132441; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px;">Events not delivered</h4>
          <p style="margin: 5px 0 0; color: #6b7c93; font-size: 13px;">
            From <%= @from.utc.strftime("%Y-%m-%d %H:%M UTC") %><br>
            To <%= @to.utc.strftime("%Y-%m-%d %H:%M UTC") %>
          </p>

          <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
            <a href="<%= @settings_url %>"
               style="display: inline-block; background-color: #2A86FF; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 28px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15px;">
              Open event stream settings
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p style="margin: 0 0 20px 0; color: #4a4a4a; font-size: 15px;">
          To fill the gap, run an export for that range into this destination.
        </p>
